# Coordinator Audio

Console owns Coordinator onboarding intro media:

- `public/sounds/twin-onboarding-intro.mp3`
- `public/sounds/twin-onboarding-intro.lipsync.json`
- `src/utils/assistants/coordinator-onboarding-intro.ts`
- `src/components/Pages/Assistants/Coordinator/CoordinatorOnboardingCallIntro.tsx`

Walkie/radio treatment is not Console-owned. Generate Droid/Twin walkie audio
through branding's `npm run audio:walkie` pipeline only.

Rules:

- Do not hand-code walkie FFmpeg filters, `anoisesrc`, static/hiss beds, or
  carrier mixes in Console scripts or one-off terminal snippets.
- For production radio-sounding segments, use the full wrapped treatment, not
  standalone voice mode plus a local approximation.
- For partial replacements, preserve the existing audio, generate the
  replacement with the same treatment as adjacent preserved audio, and measure
  splice loudness before finalizing.
- Keep generated Coordinator intro media in Console; do not move it back into
  `branding`.

Workflow doc: `docs/coordinator-onboarding-audio.md`.
